      { t: "find", q: "Find a phrase in paragraph 3 that means 'suddenly becomes unable to think or remember anything'.", a: ["goes blank", "go blank", "a mind that goes blank"], x: "goes blank = يفرغ الذهن فجأة." },
      { t: "open", q: "Choose ONE technique from the article that could help you before an exam. Explain why.", m: "Slow breathing could help me, because it calms my body and my thoughts, so my mind is less likely to go blank when I read the first question.", x: "تُقبل أي تقنية مذكورة (التنفس البطيء، العبارات الإيجابية، الروتين الثابت، التصوّر الذهني، تقسيم الهدف) إذا شرحتَ السبب بجملة كاملة." }
